Lionheart Fixt is an unofficial fan modification for the video game
"Lionheart: Legacy of the Crusader".

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Black Isle Studios,
Reflexive Entertainment, Interplay Entertainment, GOG, or any current or former
rights holder in the game. All trademarks are the property of their respective
owners.

The MIT license in LICENSE covers this project's own work: the resource files
authored here, the deltas, the tooling and the documentation. It does not and
cannot grant any rights in "Lionheart: Legacy of the Crusader" itself.

WHAT THIS PROJECT DISTRIBUTES

A release contains no content from the game. Files that already exist in a
player's installation ship as deltas -- descriptions of the differences between
their copy and the modded version -- and are reconstructed locally during
installation from the copy the player already owns. Only newly authored files
are distributed in full.

This mod is useless without a legally obtained copy of the game, which it does
not include, replace, or make redistributable.
